config BR2_PACKAGE_ZLYME_JACKD
	bool "zlyme-jackd"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	help
	  Sends audio to the headphones or the speaker, following the jack.

	  Both are outputs of the rk817, selected by one mixer control that
	  nothing changes on its own, so without this the output stays wherever
	  the driver left it and plugging in headphones does nothing.

	  Watches the evdev switch that simple-audio-card's hp-det publishes,
	  and writes Playback Mux (HP / SPK). The card also has a Headphones
	  Jack kcontrol; that reports insertion and does not change the mux.
